    <string name="settings_always_on_active">Always-on VPN is active. The network is blocked if the tunnel drops.</string>
    <string name="settings_always_on_not_armed">Not armed yet. Turn on Always-on VPN for this app, plus &quot;Block connections without VPN&quot;.</string>
